{"seq":1,"slug":"webaudio-processing","title":"Web Audio 与音频处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/practice/webaudio-processing","wordCount":953,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"web-audio-与音频处理\">Web Audio 与音频处理</h1><p>播放一个 mp3，<code>&lt;audio&gt;</code> 元素就够了。但要做实时混音、均衡器、空间音频、人声变调、频谱可视化、或给 WebRTC 通话加降噪——就需要 Web Audio API。它把音频处理建模成一张可连接的节点图，让 JavaScript 像搭模块合成器一样组合音频效果。这一篇讲这套图模型，以及它如何与前面章节的媒体轨道协同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Web Audio 的一切围绕 <code>AudioContext</code>——一个代表音频处理图的运行环境。图里是各种 <code>AudioNode</code>：源节点（产生声音）、处理节点（变换声音）、目的节点（输出到扬声器）。你用 <code>connect()</code> 把节点串成一条或多条处理链，音频数据像流水一样从源流经处理节点到达目的地。所有处理在专门的音频线程上以采样精度运行，不受主线程卡顿影响。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[源节点&lt;br/&gt;MediaStreamSource/Oscillator/Buffer] --&gt; B[GainNode 音量]&#10;  B --&gt; C[BiquadFilter 滤波]&#10;  C --&gt; D[DynamicsCompressor 压缩]&#10;  D --&gt; E[AnalyserNode 分析]&#10;  E --&gt; F[AudioDestinationNode 扬声器]&#10;  A --&gt; G[AudioWorkletNode&lt;br/&gt;自定义 DSP]&#10;  G --&gt; F&#10;  H[PannerNode 空间化] --&gt; F&#10;  C --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  A[源节点&lt;br/&gt;MediaStreamSource/Oscillator/Buffer] --&gt; B[GainNode 音量]\n  B --&gt; C[BiquadFilter 滤波]\n  C --&gt; D[DynamicsCompressor 压缩]\n  D --&gt; E[AnalyserNode 分析]\n  E --&gt; F[AudioDestinationNode 扬声器]\n  A --&gt; G[AudioWorkletNode&lt;br/&gt;自定义 DSP]\n  G --&gt; F\n  H[PannerNode 空间化] --&gt; F\n  C --&gt; H</pre><p>下表列出几类常用节点及其职责，它们是搭建音频图的积木：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>节点</th>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>MediaStreamAudioSourceNode</code></td>\n<td>源</td>\n<td>把 getUserMedia 音轨接入图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GainNode</code></td>\n<td>处理</td>\n<td>控制音量、做淡入淡出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>BiquadFilterNode</code></td>\n<td>处理</td>\n<td>低通/高通/带通滤波，均衡器基础</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AnalyserNode</code></td>\n<td>分析</td>\n<td>提供 FFT 频域/时域数据，做可视化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AudioWorkletNode</code></td>\n<td>处理</td>\n<td>运行自定义 DSP 代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AudioDestinationNode</code></td>\n<td>目的</td>\n<td>输出到扬声器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"构建处理链\">构建处理链</h2><p>搭一条处理链就是创建节点并 <code>connect</code>。下面把一路输入接上增益、滤波、再到输出，是均衡器和音量控制的雏形。注意 <code>AudioContext</code> 因自动播放策略，必须在用户手势后 <code>resume()</code> 才能出声。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const ctx = new AudioContext();&#10;await ctx.resume(); // 需用户手势触发&#10;&#10;const stream = await navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia({ audio: true });&#10;const source = ctx.createMediaStreamSource(stream);&#10;&#10;const gain = ctx.createGain();&#10;gain.gain.value = 0.8;&#10;&#10;const filter = ctx.createBiquadFilter();&#10;filter.type = &#39;highpass&#39;;&#10;filter.frequency.value = 100; // 滤掉 100Hz 以下低频噪声&#10;&#10;source.connect(filter).connect(gain).connect(ctx.destination);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ctx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AudioContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">resume</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 需用户手势触发</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> stream</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> navigator.mediaDevices.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getUserMedia</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ audio: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> source</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createMediaStreamSource</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(stream);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> gain</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createGain</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gain.gain.value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> filter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createBiquadFilter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">filter.type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'highpass'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">filter.frequency.value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 滤掉 100Hz 以下低频噪声</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">source.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">connect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(filter).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">connect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(gain).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">connect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx.destination);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>参数（如 <code>gain.gain</code>、<code>filter.frequency</code>）不是普通数字，而是 <code>AudioParam</code>，支持采样级的自动化：用 <code>setValueAtTime</code>、<code>linearRampToValueAtTime</code>、<code>exponentialRampToValueAtTime</code> 可以做出平滑无爆音的渐变。例如淡出一段声音用 <code>gain.gain.linearRampToValueAtTime(0, ctx.currentTime + 0.5)</code>，比直接赋 0 听感好得多——突变会产生「咔哒」声。</p>\n<h2 id=\"audioworklet-自定义-dsp\">AudioWorklet：自定义 DSP</h2><p>内置节点覆盖不了的需求（自定义降噪、变声、合成算法），用 <code>AudioWorklet</code>。它让你的 DSP 代码运行在独立的音频渲染线程，逐块（128 采样）处理音频，延迟极低、不受主线程影响。它取代了已废弃的 <code>ScriptProcessorNode</code>（后者在主线程跑、易卡顿）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// processor.js — 运行在音频线程&#10;class GainProcessor extends AudioWorkletProcessor {&#10;  process(inputs, outputs) {&#10;    const input = inputs[0];&#10;    const output = outputs[0];&#10;    for (let ch = 0; ch &lt; input.length; ch++) {&#10;      for (let i = 0; i &lt; input[ch].length; i++) {&#10;        output[ch][i] = input[ch][i] * 0.5; // 简单衰减&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;    return true; // 保持节点存活&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;registerProcessor(&#39;gain-processor&#39;, GainProcessor);&#10;&#10;// 主线程&#10;await ctx.audioWorklet.addModule(&#39;processor.js&#39;);&#10;const node = new AudioWorkletNode(ctx, &#39;gain-processor&#39;);&#10;source.connect(node).connect(ctx.destination);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// processor.js — 运行在音频线程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GainProcessor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AudioWorkletProcessor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">inputs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">outputs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> input</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inputs[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> outputs[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; ch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> input.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; ch</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> input[ch].</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        output[ch][i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> input[ch][i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 简单衰减</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 保持节点存活</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">registerProcessor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gain-processor'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, GainProcessor);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 主线程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx.audioWorklet.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addModule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'processor.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AudioWorkletNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gain-processor'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">source.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">connect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">connect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx.destination);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>AudioWorklet 里做重计算时，常配合 WebAssembly（把 C/Rust 写的 DSP 编译进来）以达到原生性能。主线程与 worklet 之间通过 <code>port.postMessage</code> 通信传参数。需要逐采样精细控制、或要跑深度学习降噪模型时，这是唯一可行的路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与-webrtc-可视化的协同\">与 WebRTC、可视化的协同</h2><p>Web Audio 与 WebRTC 是天然搭档。一方面，可以把 getUserMedia 的音轨接进音频图做处理（降噪、增益），再用 <code>MediaStreamAudioDestinationNode</code> 导出成新轨道送进 <code>RTCPeerConnection</code>（见 <a href=\"../foundations/webrtc-architecture\">WebRTC 架构与连接模型</a>）——实现「发送前先处理」。另一方面，可以把远端收到的音轨接入 <code>AnalyserNode</code> 做实时频谱/音量可视化（如说话人高亮）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 把处理后的音频导出为可发送的轨道&#10;const dest = ctx.createMediaStreamDestination();&#10;gain.connect(dest);&#10;const processedTrack = dest.stream.getAudioTracks()[0];&#10;// processedTrack 可经 replaceTrack 送入 RTCPeerConnection&#10;&#10;// 音量可视化&#10;const analyser = ctx.createAnalyser();&#10;analyser.fftSize = 256;&#10;source.connect(analyser);&#10;const data = new Uint8Array(analyser.frequencyBinCount);&#10;function tick() {&#10;  analyser.getByteFrequencyData(data);&#10;  const volume = data.reduce((a, b) =&gt; a + b, 0) / data.length;&#10;  requestAnimationFrame(tick);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 把处理后的音频导出为可发送的轨道</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dest</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createMediaStreamDestination</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gain.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">connect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(dest);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> processedTrack</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dest.stream.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getAudioTracks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// processedTrack 可经 replaceTrack 送入 RTCPeerConnection</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 音量可视化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> analyser</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createAnalyser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">analyser.fftSize </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">source.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">connect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(analyser);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Uint8Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(analyser.frequencyBinCount);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  analyser.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getByteFrequencyData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> volume</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  requestAnimationFrame</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tick);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>下表归纳 Web Audio 在音视频系统里的几个高频用途：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>关键节点</th>\n<th>场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>发送前处理</td>\n<td>Source → 处理 → StreamDestination</td>\n<td>通话降噪、增益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接收端可视化</td>\n<td>Source → Analyser</td>\n<td>说话人音量条、频谱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间音频</td>\n<td>PannerNode</td>\n<td>虚拟会议室方位感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义 DSP</td>\n<td>AudioWorklet (+ Wasm)</td>\n<td>变声、AI 降噪</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>视频侧的逐帧处理（背景虚化等）则走另一套机制，见 <a href=\"recording-transforms\">录制、Insertable Streams 与 WebCodecs</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Web Audio 把音频处理建模成 <code>AudioContext</code> 下的节点图，源→处理→目的用 <code>connect</code> 串联，运行在独立音频线程。</li>\n<li>常用节点覆盖增益、滤波、压缩、分析、空间化；<code>AudioParam</code> 支持采样级自动化，用渐变避免爆音。</li>\n<li>因自动播放策略，<code>AudioContext</code> 须在用户手势后 <code>resume()</code>。</li>\n<li><code>AudioWorklet</code> 在音频线程跑自定义 DSP（取代 ScriptProcessorNode），重计算常配 WebAssembly。</li>\n<li>与 WebRTC 协同：处理后音轨经 <code>MediaStreamAudioDestinationNode</code> 导出再 <code>replaceTrack</code> 送出；远端音轨经 <code>AnalyserNode</code> 做可视化。</li>\n<li>视频逐帧处理走 <a href=\"recording-transforms\">录制、Insertable Streams 与 WebCodecs</a>，与本篇的音频处理互补。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Web Audio 与音频处理","id":"web-audio-与音频处理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"构建处理链","id":"构建处理链"},{"level":2,"text":"AudioWorklet：自定义 DSP","id":"audioworklet-自定义-dsp"},{"level":2,"text":"与 WebRTC、可视化的协同","id":"与-webrtc-可视化的协同"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"质量、拥塞控制与统计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/realtime/quality-congestion"},"next":{"title":"录制、Insertable Streams 与 WebCodecs","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/practice/recording-transforms"}}